PHASE SIGMA %  3 8   4   18 !



$NOTE: In austenitic stainless steels, set Ni% instead of Fe% on sublattice 1.



$Intermetallic transition elements compound with broad solid solubility range.



$Tetragonal with five non-equivalent sites.



